denas de hierro;"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["Para ejecutar en ellos el juicio escrito: gloria será ésta para todos sus santos. Alabad al SEÑOR."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/spa_v2p/PSA/149.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_v2p/PSA/150.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_v2p/PSA/148.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}